a.record('pfp/domain/immune/models.py',251,651,'HostReplayReceipt and DetectionContext are passive trusted-host inputs: receipt signer/authority are not authenticated here. Detector normalizes supplied candidate with ordinary JSON, hashes raw evidence separately without proving raw bytes decode to candidate, and selects nested candidate as a structural semantic digest. Twelve named detectors are literal key/phrase heuristics, caller branch counts and seen-digest lookups, not truth or proof checking. Host replay acceptance checks caller replay_passed and target digest only; authenticity must be supplied externally. Optimality/complexity/private-CoT phrases can trigger without contextual proof analysis. Persona grant substring can suppress a marker; findings deduplicate by code/detail. A clean report means no configured heuristic fired. Failure/host records themselves do not perform quarantine or repair.')
a.record('pfp/domain/immune/thymus.py',1,416,'Finite negative selection against supplied clean strings is reusable conditional filtering. Entry and panel digests are length-checked but never recomputed; canonical loader trusts supplied sealed/content hashes and derives count from entries. Sequence construction seals only entry IDs, so content can change under same seal. Distinct-base count strips generated index/hash suffixes. Regex matching has no execution budget; invalid patterns get typed refusal, any match produces a purged label without deleting rule or parent. No match certifies only nonintersection with this supplied finite panel, not healthy ground truth or unseen self-tolerance. Selection result permits inconsistent admission/violation fields through direct construction. Panel data body has not yet been reviewed.')
a.record('pfp/domain/immune/clonal_selection.py',1,373,'Clonal candidate validates basic scalar shapes but affinity can be negative and Q-like values are not normalized. Mutation IDs depend on parent/generation rather than pattern and mutation reactivates inactive parents. Kill-condition checker tests regex over supplied entries, trusts supplied content digests, and does not bind clone.parent_id to parent.rule_id; purged status is only a returned receipt. Invalid regex returns False with refusal, so boolean-only callers could conflate refusal with cleanliness. Empty sequence is accepted as no violation. Stimulation allows negative boosts. For fixed positive tau, decay exponent is the difference of completed-interval floors, giving correct batched/incremental telescoping; deactivation independently uses half_life_runs. No actual repertoire mutation, resource budget or measured biological affinity is established.')
